EnemyChase(Normal){

  * (Normal):
  | Got(A) ? Rest :(Angry)

  | Cell(F,V) ? 85% Move(F) / 8% Turn(L) / 7% Turn(R) :(Normal)

  | Cell(L,V) & Cell(R,V) ? 50% Turn(L) / 50% Turn(R) :(Normal)
  | Cell(L,V) ? Turn(L) :(Normal)
  | Cell(R,V) ? Turn(R) :(Normal)

  | Cell(B,V) ? Turn(B) :(Normal)
  | True ? Rest :(Normal)


  * (Angry):
  | ! Got(A) ? Rest :(Normal)

  | Closest(@,F) & Cell(F,V) ? Move(F) :(Angry)
  | Closest(@,L) & Cell(L,V) ? Turn(L) :(Angry)
  | Closest(@,R) & Cell(R,V) ? Turn(R) :(Angry)

  | Cell(F,V) ? 90% Move(F) / 5% Turn(L) / 5% Turn(R) :(Angry)

  | Cell(L,V) & Cell(R,V) ? 50% Turn(L) / 50% Turn(R) :(Angry)
  | Cell(L,V) ? Turn(L) :(Angry)
  | Cell(R,V) ? Turn(R) :(Angry)

  | Closest(@,B) & Cell(B,V) ? Turn(B) :(Angry)
  | Cell(B,V) ? Turn(B) :(Angry)

  | True ? Rest :(Angry)
}